  "description": "Go-Eun Lee is unlucky in love. She poured her money, heart, soul, and money (did we mention money?!) into her ex-boyfriend...who repaid Go-Eun by cheating on her. Despite the hurt, she decides to leave the past in the past. Now love is the last thing on her mind. But for CEO Woo-Hyuk Baek, Go-Eun is always the first thought on his mind. Now that she's single, it's his chance to make a move! As if work isn't hectic enough, why not throw a little romance into the mix?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
